MODULE: SmoothedWaitRefusalAdmits
TARGET: SmoothedWaitRefusal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: excessive fresh wait takes the holding outcome instead of refusal
PERTURBS: RefuseWait

--- FIND
RefuseWait(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "pending" /\ RefuseForWait(r)
    /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![r] = "refused"]
--- REPLACE
RefuseWait(r) ==
    /\ status[r] = "pending" /\ RefuseForWait(r)
    /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![r] = "holding"]
--- END
